                        "en": {
                            "title": "Back to building: {{Voxara}}",
                            "province": "",
                            "country": "US",
                            "institution": "",
                            "text": "First meaningful personal project in a while. Voxara targets a gap I noticed: platforms like Orai, Yoodli, ELSA Speak, and Speeko are built for professional public speaking or language learning, not theatre performers and voice actors who need actionable feedback between rehearsals. Targeting high school through college students in voice acting and theatre. Currently in the early-to-mid build phase — core loop of recording, processing, storing, and giving feedback isn't wired up yet."
                        }
                    }
                },
