                            "title": "Continuing {{VIP AIE}} this fall",
                            "province": "",
                            "country": "US",
                            "institution": "",
                            "text": "Continuing with the VIP AI in Education (AIE) team at Purdue this fall. Last cycle, our multimodal sub-team designed how a multimodal RAG chatbot, unified MCP client, and MCP servers should fit together, though we mostly worked on individual pieces. Looking forward to diving back in and exploring: integrating everything together, rigorous testing, deploying into Pete Chat (ECE 20875's student Q&A platform), and possibly Brightspace and LTSpice MCP server integrations for better circuit rendering."
                        }
